Three raylib games

Install libgpu, libtinygl and libraylib, then build inside generated9:

    cd /sys/src/games/raygames
    mk install
    mk test

Run in rio with the VirtIO/VirGL setup from boot/GPU.md:

    games/arkanoid
    games/asteroids
    games/missile

No external assets are needed. See raygames(1) for controls and options.
The frame-based logic slows when rendering cannot sustain 60 fps.
Paused and game-over windows wait for events, except in fixed-frame runs.

mk test checks game logic without a window. For a repeatable graphics run:

    games/arkanoid -n 120 -s 1 -o /tmp/arkanoid.png

The same options work for the other games. Tested on amd64/QEMU VirGL.
Source revisions, authors and licenses are in UPSTREAM and LICENSE.
